+      simp only [Finset.mem_insert, Finset.mem_singleton] at hzSource hzXv
+      rcases hzSource with rfl | rfl <;> rcases hzXv with h | h
+      · exact huNeXvPoint h
+      · exact P.huNeV (Subtype.ext h)
+      · exact hxuNeXv h
+      · exact hxuNeV h
+    · rw [hJdeleted]
